  S("IL","SB 2022",18,"introduced","2026-03-12","Added as Chief Co-Sponsor Sen. Mattie Hunter","SAFE PATIENT LIMITS ACT","Creates the Safe Patient Limits Act. Provides the maximum number of patients that may be assigned to a registered nurse in specified situations. Provides that nothing shall preclude a facility from assigning fewer patients to a registered nurse than the limits provided in the Act. Provides that the maximum patient assignments may not be exceeded, regardless of the use and application of any patient acuity system. Requires the Department of…",[],"https://ilga.gov/Legislation/BillStatus?DocNum=2022&GAID=18&DocTypeID=SB&LegId=161440&SessionID=114",1,1);
